s", "description": "<p>Phénomène du rythme, multi instrumentiste inimitable, on le dit empereur du rythme et génie du groove !<br />\nDepuis 50 ans, sur les scènes du monde entier, Paco Séry a joué avec Nina Simone, Jaco Pastorius, Wayne Shorter, Salif Keita, Marvin Gaye, son groupe fétiche Sixun… Une frappe terrible, un jeu sans calcul, d’une générosité pure, celui qui a été récompensé par un Grammy Award* vit la musique comme une respiration.<br />\nPaco Sery fête ses 70 ans au Sunset , son club fétiche.Venez nombreux partager ces deux jours de fête !</p>", "excerpt": "", "slug": "paco-sery-friends", "image": {"url": "https://www.sunset-sunside.com/app/uploads/2026/07/PHOTO-2026-07-27-18-39-18.webp", "id": 164288, "extension": "webp", "width": 480, "height": 480, "filesize": "8702", "sizes": {"medium": {"width": 300, "height": 300, "mime-type": "image/webp", "filesize": "4374", "url": "https://www.sunset-sunside.com/app/uploads/2026/07/PHOTO-2026-07-27-18-39-18-300x300.webp"}, "thumbnail": {"width": 150, "height": 150, "mime-type": "image/webp", "filesize": "1940", "url": "https://www.sunset-sunside.com/app/uploads/2026/07/PHOTO-2026-07-27-18-39-18-150x150.webp"}, "woocommerce_thumbnail": {"width": 338, "height": 338, "mime-type": "image/webp", "filesize": "5338", "uncropped": false, "url": "https://www.sunset-sunside.com/app/uploads/2026/07/PHOTO-2026-07-27-18-39-18-338x338.webp"}, "woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail": {"width": 100, "height": 100, "mime-type": "image/webp", "filesize": "1226", "url": "https://www.sunset-sunside.com/app/uploads/2026/07/PHOTO-2026-07-27-18-39-18-100x100.webp"}, "variation_swatches_image_size": {"width": 50, "height": 50, "mime-type": "image/webp", "filesize": "526", "url": "https://www.sunset-sunside.com/app/uploads/2026/07/PHOTO-2026-07-27-18-39-18-50x50.webp"}, "variation_swatches_tooltip_size": {"width": 100, "height": 100, "mime-type": "image/webp", "filesize": "1226", "url": "https://www.sunset-sunside.com/app/uploads/2026/07/PHOT